<title>SPAIN: WATER POLO-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>WATER POLO-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SEVILLE 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the third day of the European Championships in Seville on Friday:</p>
<p>Women's preliminary rounds</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>Greece beat Yugoslavia 8-2 (1-0 1-0 2-1 4-1)</p>
<p>Hungary beat Czech Republic 26-2 (8-0 8-1 5-1 5-0)</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>Netherlands beat Portugal 22-2 (6-0 4-0 6-1 6-1)</p>
<p>Italy beat Britain 14-7 (3-3 2-1 4-1 5-2)</p>
<p>Russia beat Spain 8-1 (2-0 1-1 4-0 1-0)</p>
<p>Men's preliminary rounds</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>Hungary beat Slovakia 12-6 (2-2 3-1 3-2 4-1)</p>
<p>Men's preliminary rounds</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>Greece beat Bulgaria 8-4 (1-3 2-1 2-0 3-0)</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>Croatia beat Ukraine 7-3 (4-2 3-0 0-0 0-1)</p>
<p>Women's preliminary rounds</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>Germany beat France 7-5 (3-1 1-1 1-2 2-1)</p>
<p>Men's preliminary rounds</p>
<p>Group A </p>
<p>Russia beat Germany 8-6  (2-1, 1-3, 2-0, 3-2)</p>
<p>Yugoslavia beat Italy 4-3  (2-1, 1-0, 1-0, 0-2)</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>Spain beat Netherlands 7-3 (2-0, 1-1,1-0, 3-2)</p>
